From f1d76bde22ef533380ee8fb36aa40ef216b57d0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.net>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:56:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] init: start notify services in parallel, wait where a unit
 requires them

init no longer waits for each notify service before it goes on. It waits
for one where a later unit requires it, directly or through a target,
and when nothing else can start. The root file system no longer waits
for dwc2d (USB); netstack does (#47, boot time).
---
 init.d/10_smolnetd.service      |   2 +
 init.initfs.d/40_drivers.target |   1 -
 init.initfs.d/90_initfs.target  |   4 +-
 init/src/main.rs                |   1 +
 init/src/scheduler.rs           | 102 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 init/src/service.rs             |  70 +++++++++++++++++-----
 init/src/unit.rs                |   4 ++
 7 files changed, 154 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

